  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Social Protection and Labor Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proteccin integrada Social y el Programa de Trabajo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo es guardar los avances en la reduccin de pobreza y bajar las vulnerabilidades de los pobres durante una recession econmica. Especficamente: (i) proteger gastos pblicos en salud, educacin y proteccin social; (ii) mejorar la efectividad de las reformas importantes para programas de proteccin social.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this operation is to help preserve recent gains in poverty reduction and redudce vulnerability of the poor during a time of economic downturn. Specific objectives: (i) protect basic health, education, and safety net spending during the economic downturn; (ii) improve effectivness of reforms to important social safety net programs.</narrative>
  </description>
